           placed by eye, at a fixed 0.09 units/mm (see
           docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-02-car-diagram-blueprint-redraw-design.md). The
           previous hand-drawn version was 2.51:1 where a real sedan is 3.35:1 — a car drawn
           ~25% too stubby, with a wheelbase ~15% short of what its own overhangs implied.

           Load-bearing landmarks, all mm-derived: nose x=9, tail x=451 (4910mm), ground
           y=150, roof y=19 (1467mm), front axle x=84 (836mm overhang), rear axle x=351
           (2964mm wheelbase). Shape is traced; styling is deliberately brand-neutral. *@
        <svg class="car-view" data-view="left" viewBox="0 0 460 165" role="img" aria-label="Left side of the car">
            <path class="car-body" d="M9,138 L9,100 C9,87 17,78 32,73 L72,66 L180,50 L234,19 L324,20 L369,45 L432,51 C444,54 451,65 451,84 L451,138 Z" />
            <circle class="car-arch" cx="84" cy="120" r="34" />
            <circle class="car-arch" cx="351" cy="120" r="34" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="FrontBumper" d="M9,138 L9,100 C9,87 17,78 32,73 L66,67 L68,138 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="HeadlightLeft" d="M32,76 L68,68 L70,86 L34,90 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="Bonnet" d="M68,68 L180,50 L182,64 L72,82 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="WingFrontLeft" d="M72,82 L140,70 L140,132 L68,132 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="Windscreen" d="M180,50 L234,19 L241,23 L187,46 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="Roof" d="M234,19 L324,20 L323,29 L236,29 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="RearWindscreen" d="M324,20 L369,45 L359,50 L315,25 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="DoorFrontLeft" d="M140,70 L187,46 L243,46 L243,132 L140,132 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="DoorRearLeft" d="M243,46 L317,46 L317,132 L243,132 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="QuarterRearLeft" d="M317,46 L369,46 L430,52 L430,138 L317,138 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="BootTailgate" d="M369,45 L432,51 L434,64 L366,58 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="RearBumper" d="M432,51 C444,54 451,65 451,84 L451,138 L430,138 L430,58 Z" />
            <path class="cp" data-part="TaillightLeft" d="M406,56 L430,60 L430,76 L406,72 Z" />
            <rect class="cp" data-part="SillLeft" x="140" y="132" width="177" height="8" rx="3" />
            <g class="car-detail">
                <path d="M140,70 L140,132 M243,46 L243,132 M317,46 L317,132 M72,82 L140,70 M369,46 L369,58" />
