            <path class="cp" data-part="MirrorLeft" d="M186,46 l-18,3 l3,11 l18,-4 Z" />
        </svg>

        @* ---------- RIGHT SIDE (mirrored) ----------
           A mirror of the left view rather than a second hand-drawn copy: half the work, and
           the two sides cannot drift apart when one is edited. Only the L/R part names differ. *@
        <svg class="car-view" data-view="right" viewBox="0 0 460 165" role="img" aria-label="Right side of the car">
